  "contentHtml": "<p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/999A273F5F3F62D71E\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"219\" height=\"322\" style=\"width: 219px; height: 322px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"445\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"씨름.jpg\"  id=\"A_999A273F5F3F62D71E1727\"/></p><p>개학하자 마자 진도 나가기도 그렇고 해서 1시간 정도 가볍게 흥미 유발시키기 위해 만든 자료입니다.</p><p>오주석의 한국의미 특강에서 참고한 내용입니다.</p><p>학생들에게 그림을 보여 주고 몇가지 질문을&nbsp;던져 관찰 또는 추론하라고 하였습니다.</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; unicode-bidi: embed; direction: ltr; language: ko; mso-line-break-override: none; punctuation-wrap: hanging;\"><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: en-US; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>1. </span><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: ko; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>씨름이\r\n시작한지 오래 되었는가</span><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: en-US; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>?\r\n</span><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: ko; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>시작한 지 얼마 안되었는가</span><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: en-US; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>?</span><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: ko; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n\r\n<span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: ko; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">시작한 지 시간이 좀 흘렀다</span></span><span style='color: rgb(0, 85, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: en-US; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n\r\n<span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: ko; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>&nbsp; 이유\r\n</span><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: en-US; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>: </span><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: ko; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>오른쪽 위에 팔베개를 하고 있는 사람으로 미루어 보아 씨름이\r\n시작한지 좀 되었다는 것을 알 수 있다</span><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: en-US; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n\r\n<span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: ko; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 전체적으로\r\n사람들의 자세가 많이 편안해 보인다</span><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: en-US; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n\r\n<br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; unicode-bidi: embed; direction: ltr; language: ko; mso-line-break-override: none; punctuation-wrap: hanging;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: en-US; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>2. </span><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: ko; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>다음\r\n씨름에 나갈 선수를 </span><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: ko; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>찾으시오</span><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: en-US; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n\r\n<span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: ko; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">&nbsp; 왼쪽 중간에 무릎을 세우고 있는 사람</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n\r\n<span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: ko; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 이유\r\n</span><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: en-US; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>: </span><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: ko; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>긴장한 자세이며 신발을 벗어 놓고 있다</span><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: en-US; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n\r\n<br></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; unicode-bidi: embed; direction: ltr; language: ko; mso-line-break-override: none; punctuation-wrap: hanging;\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: en-US; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>3. </span><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: ko; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>두명의\r\n씨름 선수는 신분에 차이가 있을 것으로 보인다</span><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; mso-ascii-font-family: \"맑은 고딕\"; language: en-US; mso-bidi-font-family: +mn-cs; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-color-index: 1; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: text1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;'>.\r\n</span><span style='color: black; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-siz